# Held depth (an extension): the extrusion of path_extrude, its depth
# held from its group screen, which takes its last freedom, then typed
# as 25 and as an expression; Analyze > Check Solid finds the solids
# sound. Undo takes the expression back, and the depth is freed again.
key r
move 200 200
down L 200 200
up L 200 200
move 380 330
down L 380 330
up L 380 330
key esc
key x shift
tw
twmove 501 125
twdown L 501 125
twup L 501 125
tw
twmove 501 125
twdown L 501 125
twup L 501 125
edit 25
tw
answer ok
menu Analyze|Check Solid
twmove 501 125
twdown L 501 125
twup L 501 125
edit 5*6
tw
answer ok
menu Analyze|Check Solid
key z ctrl
twmove 150 155
twdown L 150 155
twup L 150 155
tw
twmove 582 125
twdown L 582 125
twup L 582 125
tw
